# Local planning and review records
# Only these three Markdown documents belong in the published codebase.
*.[mM][dD]
!/README.md
!/docs/protocol.md
!/docs/scoring-audit.md
/CITATION.cff
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/
/.github/pull_request_template.md
/implementation_steps.txt
